                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Brilliant game as far as I can tell. I'm 10 missions in out of what I believe to be 14. The first half of the game went fairly fast and I was worried I'd complete it faster than I'd want having spent £30 on it, but the second half slowed down quite considerably although the fun remains.\n\nThere is little to no hand holding and at times you will have to employ trial and error, but taking a step back and thinking about the situation has helped me solve a puzzle 100% of the time so far and I wouldn't call any of the platforming or puzzles unfair.\n\nOnly small gripe I have is with the liberal use of invisible walls as they have forced me to turn from what I considered to be a perfectly viable route at times, otherwise the gameplay is fun, the puzzles take a bit of thought and the graphics are beautiful.\n\nIf you enjoyed the mod Portal Reloaded, I really think you'll love this game.",
